# Plain .env was TRACKED in this public repo until Phase 527 (it held
# CI=false, a Create React App workaround — no credentials, but the gap was
# real: only the CRA .env.*.local variants below were ignored, so a future
# .env with real keys would have been committable into a public repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
design/kua-data-flow.html
